<section id="about" class="section container about-section" aria-labelledby="about-title">
  <div class="about-grid">
    <div class="about-heading"><p class="eyebrow">A LITTLE MORE ME</p><h2 id="about-title">Lagos will always<br />be part of the story.</h2></div>
    <div class="about-copy">
      <p class="large-copy">I grew up in Lagos, moved to Canada at 18, and now call San Francisco home.</p>
      <p>I studied software engineering at the University of Ottawa.</p>
      <p><strong>At Ford, I was part of the camera team and later worked on drive modes.</strong> I helped build software that used information about a vehicle’s surroundings to make decisions about where to park and when to switch drive modes.</p>
      <p>I’ve also worked at Morgan Stanley and Kinaxis, helped build <a href="https://www.softwareforlove.com/" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Software for Love</a>, and found my way into building companies.</p>
      <p><strong>Making Nigeria a better place to live is one of the things that drives me.</strong> It’s part of what draws me to building businesses in technology and agriculture.</p>
      <p>I enjoy mentoring people and meeting others who are curious about the world and willing to try something.</p>
      <div class="journey" aria-label="From Lagos to Canada to San Francisco"><span><i class="nigeria-flag" aria-hidden="true"></i>Lagos</span><Arrow /><span>Canada</span><Arrow /><span>San Francisco</span></div>
    </div>
  </div>

</section>
